            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.21.1+JOS.21.2+JOS.21.3+JOS.21.4+JOS.21.5+JOS.21.6+JOS.21.7+JOS.21.8+JOS.21.9+JOS.21.10+JOS.21.11+JOS.21.12+JOS.21.13+JOS.21.14+JOS.21.15+JOS.21.16+JOS.21.17+JOS.21.18+JOS.21.19+JOS.21.20+JOS.21.21+JOS.21.22+JOS.21.23+JOS.21.24+JOS.21.25+JOS.21.26+JOS.21.27+JOS.21.28+JOS.21.29+JOS.21.30+JOS.21.31+JOS.21.32+JOS.21.33+JOS.21.34+JOS.21.35+JOS.21.36+JOS.21.37+JOS.21.38+JOS.21.39+JOS.21.40+JOS.21.41+JOS.21.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 21:1-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa i kam'obipere ma Mowab i thengi malawa Yordan i Yeriko ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wodhi or ri Joisiraili miyo Jolevi tindin ma jolabed'iye wok i lim pajo. Iripo bende miyo jo lowo ma kwath m'othoko tindin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindin labedo apa joma jolabed'iye, aka lowo ma kwath labedo ri dhok pajo, ri mwendi pajo kodi ri ogwaŋe pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowo ma kwath, m'ilamiyo ri Jolevi, lawok yuwoko wok i kor tindi madwoŋ mita 450 i kisi thenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilakipima woko ma tindi madwoŋ mita 900 i kisi thenge, gi tindi madwoŋ i diere. Me labedo kakwath ri tindi pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilamiyo Jolevi tindin aucel ma pondo kama dhano nyalo ring'iye ka oneko nyawote ma k'ogendera. Medo i wiye ilamiyo Jolevi tindin piero aŋwen g'ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindin m'ilamiyo Jolevi je ripo bedo piero aŋwen g'aboro, kiri gi lowo ma kwath pajo je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'imiyo Jolevi tindin wok i lim pa Joisiraili, wok i nonin madongo ilakwanyo mathoth, aka wok i nonin mathindho ilakwanyo manok, cungo kwoŋ dwoŋo ma adec mere rom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tindin madongo ma pondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
